34	Production 근거: Production은 MongoDB `device_daily`와 현재 `resources_ward`를 함께 읽지만(`analyze_utils.py:analyze_user_stats()`), Recovery는 이 부분을 확정 정책으로 대체한다.\n\n## 3. Production과 Recovery 비교\n\n| Production | Recovery |\n|---|---|\n| `resources_location`에서 ward 선택 | `archive.resources_measurement`의 distinct non-null `ward_id` 사용 |\n| MongoDB `device_daily` 사용 | MongoDB `safeguard-staging["device-daily"]` 사용 |\n| 현재 `resources_ward` state 사용 | 시작 이전 DANGER 이력과 메모리 ward state 사용 |\n| `resources_ward` UPDATE | 메모리 state만 변경 |\n| Kafka 기반 producer/consumer pipeline | 단일 chronological replay pipeline |\n| `analyze_write_db` consumer 경유 | `archive.analysis_wardevaluation`에 직접 저장 |\n| DB trigger based state updates | Recovery policy implemented in Python memory state |\n| `ansimk.analysis_wardevaluation` 저장 | `archive.analysis_wardevaluation` 저장 |\n| 최신 daily 문서 한 건을 `find_one()` | latest daily timestamp의 모든 IMEI 후보에서 최신 non-null vital 선택 |\n\nCollection 이름은 중요한 schema 경계다. Production의 `db["device_daily"]`는 원래 동작을 설명하는 근거일 뿐이다. Recovery는 항상 다음 형태를 사용한다.\n\n```python\ndatabase["device-daily"]\n```\n\nRecovery source로 `device_daily`를 조회하거나 새로 생성하지 않는다.	[-0.024169922,-0.006439209,-0.010681152,-0.048828125,0.09814453,-0.0041503906,0.0625,-0.041992188,-0.03930664,0.022705078,-0.037109375,-0.036621094,0.0134887695,-0.009399414,-0.052978516,0.071777344,-0.03564453,-0.02722168,-0.045166016,0.083496094,0.055664062,0.010253906,0.010009766,0.061523438,-0.04272461,-0.0043945312,-0.023071289,-0.008911133,0.03125,0.009765625,0.05908203,0.0028076172,-0.07421875,-0.036621094,0.0390625,-0.012756348,-0.0057678223,0.00034332275,-0.0033416748,-0.012268066,0.011352539,0.0546875,0.095703125,0.020996094,-0.095703125,-0.11669922,0.016479492,-0.022094727,0.0051574707,0.010437012,-0.03857422,0.012512207,-0.009887695,0.0008506775,0.009643555,-0.009643555,0.03881836,-0.052490234,0.0010681152,-0.026245117,-0.017944336,0.06298828,-0.040039062,-0.045898438,0.03930664,-0.015319824,0.012634277,-0.017333984,0.