35	Collection 이름은 중요한 schema 경계다. Production의 `db["device_daily"]`는 원래 동작을 설명하는 근거일 뿐이다. Recovery는 항상 다음 형태를 사용한다.\n\n```python\ndatabase["device-daily"]\n```\n\nRecovery source로 `device_daily`를 조회하거나 새로 생성하지 않는다.\n\n## 4. 전체 Data Lineage\n\n```text\narchive.resources_measurement\n  fields: ward_id, imei, read_at,\n          remote_control_count, movement_count,\n          illumination, humidity, temperature\n  historical ownership: ward_id + imei 그대로 사용\n        |\n        v\nsafeguard-staging.device-daily\n  identity: imei + userid + Seoul daily timestamp\n  evaluation input: userid, timestamp, last_vital_sign_timestamp\n        |\n        +---------------------------+\n        |                           |\n        v                           v\nward_id별 evaluated_at          ansimk.analysis_wardevaluation\nKST 5분 시계열                start_datetime 이전 DANGER SELECT\n        |                           |\n        +-------------+-------------+\n                      v\n              Python memory ward state\n              + Production-equivalent scoring\n                      |\n                      v\n             archive.analysis_wardevaluation\n```\n\n`archive.resources_measurement.ward_id`와 `.imei`가 과거 관계의 source of truth다. `ansimk.resources_location`, 현재 device installation table, 현재 ward-device mapping을 사용해 이를 다시 매핑하지 않는다.\n\nProduction 근거: Production raw-to-ward 관계는 설치 정보를 통해 해석하지만, Recovery daily rebuild는 `rebuild_device_daily.py:load_groups()`에서 archived `ward_id`와 `imei`를 직접 사용한다.	[-0.022338867,0.030151367,-0.010437012,-0.0859375,0.056396484,-0.001914978,0.036376953,-0.033935547,-0.03955078,-0.014587402,-0.0064086914,-0.019042969,0.01928711,-0.009277344,-0.048583984,0.09472656,-0.026123047,-0.004425049,-0.056396484,0.045654297,0.06689453,0.0070495605,0.025390625,0.046875,-0.044189453,-0.036132812,-0.056396484,-0.030273438,0.07470703,0.036865234,0.045410156,0.005432129,-0.099121094,-0.045166016,-0.008300781,-0.010803223,-0.018310547,-0.056396484,-0.0152587