43	정상 계산 중 `temperature`, `humidity`, `light`는 100을 유지한다. 최종 destination의 `risk_score`를 만들 때도 `int(score)`를 사용한다.\n\nDaily 문서가 없으면 Production과 동일하게 모든 점수를 30으로 설정한다.\n\n```text\nscore = temperature = humidity = light = irCount = pirCount = 30\ndevice_has_signal = False\nuser_is_out = False\n```\n\nProduction 근거: `analyze_utils.py:get_time_of_day()`, 상수 `AFTER_MIDNIGHT_TIME`부터 `BEFORE_MIDNIGHT_TIME`, `analyze_user_stats()`의 각 시간대 분기.\n\n## 12. Risk level\n\nProduction `models.scoreToRiskLevel()`과 동일한 경계를 사용한다.\n\n| score | risk level |\n|---:|---|\n| 0–25 | `DANGER` |\n| 26–50 | `ALERT` |\n| 51–75 | `CAUTION` |\n| 76–100 | `STABLE` |\n| None 또는 0–100 밖 | `UNKNOWN` |\n\n경계 검증값은 다음과 같다.\n\n- 25 → `DANGER`\n- 26 → `ALERT`\n- 50 → `ALERT`\n- 51 → `CAUTION`\n- 75 → `CAUTION`\n- 76 → `STABLE`\n\n동일 변환을 overall, brightness, humidity, movement, remote control, temperature score에 각각 적용한다.\n\nProduction 근거: `iot-server/lib/models.py:scoreToRiskLevel()`의 `np.linspace(0, 100, 5)`와 `np.digitize(..., right=True)`.\n\n## 13. Ward state 초기화\n\n각 대상 ward는 replay 시작 전에 다음 메모리 state를 갖는다.	[-0.014465332,0.026000977,-0.0070495605,-0.0390625,0.0703125,0.021118164,0.0034484863,-0.0024871826,-0.047607422,-0.05517578,0.041015625,-0.037109375,0.037597656,-0.00793457,-0.049072266,0.09667969,-0.010620117,-0.056152344,-0.033935547,0.018798828,0.022460938,0.015014648,-0.034179688,0.03491211,-0.011230469,0.014404297,-0.040039062,0.016723633,0.056152344,0.040283203,0.0546875,0.02734375,-0.056884766,-0.025146484,0.017822266,-0.012145996,0.042236328,0.056884766,-0.008972168,0.014831543,-0.0014266968,0.022827148,0.043701172,0.03881836,-0.012145996,-0.056884766,-0.03491211,-0.025512695,-0.04321289,0.028808594,-0.068359375,0.035888672,-0.025756836,-0.004058838,0.01965332,0.021850586,0.049316406,-0.11279297,-0.03149414,0.0014724731,-0.11376953,0.008056641,-0.091796875,-0.053222656,-0.012084961,-0.014709473,0.013793945,-0.053466797,-0.037109375,0.01953125,0.01171875,-0.030273438,-0.027709961,-0.024780273,