44	Production 근거: `iot-server/lib/models.py:scoreToRiskLevel()`의 `np.linspace(0, 100, 5)`와 `np.digitize(..., right=True)`.\n\n## 13. Ward state 초기화\n\n각 대상 ward는 replay 시작 전에 다음 메모리 state를 갖는다.\n\n```text\nis_out = False\nlast_caution_check_date = None\nlast_caution_check_user = None\nlast_is_out_reason = None\ndanger_counts = start 이전 DANGER가 존재한 서로 다른 KST 날짜 수\nlast_danger_date = start 이전 마지막 DANGER의 KST 날짜\n```\n\n이전 DANGER가 없으면 `danger_counts=0`, `last_danger_date=None`이다. DANGER 날짜 수와 마지막 날짜는 `ansimk.analysis_wardevaluation`을 SELECT해서 ward별로 계산한다. `evaluated_at < start_datetime` 조건을 엄격히 적용하고 날짜는 `Asia/Seoul` calendar date로 변환한다.\n\n현재 `ansimk.resources_ward`를 초기값으로 읽거나 변경하지 않는다. 초기 query 결과에서 `danger_counts >= 7`인데 `last_danger_date=None`인 조합은 일관되지 않은 state다.\n\nProduction 근거: `analyze_utils.py:get_ward_status_for_risk_management()`가 읽는 여섯 필드. Recovery는 mutable Production snapshot 대신 위 초기화 정책을 사용한다.\n\n## 14. Ward state 전이\n\n평가는 evaluated_at 오름차순으로 수행하고, 동일 ward의 메모리 state를 다음 평가로 전달한다.\n\n메모리 필드:\n\n- `is_out`\n- `last_caution_check_date`\n- `last_caution_check_user`\n- `last_is_out_reason`\n- `danger_counts`\n- `last_danger_date`\n\n이 state는 destination 컬럼으로 저장하지 않고 `ansimk.resources_ward`에도 기록하지 않는다.\n\n`is_out=True`일 때 Production 순서를 다음과 같이 재현한다.	[-0.0057678223,0.010131836,-0.009887695,-0.040039062,0.059814453,-0.022949219,0.032470703,-0.015991211,-0.026000977,-0.011962891,0.0019683838,-0.048339844,0.05883789,-0.00970459,-0.0546875,0.07373047,-0.021728516,-0.08691406,-0.029907227,0.029907227,0.041015625,-0.0047912598,-0.009460449,0.024169922,-0.014587402,0.041015625,-0.04248047,-0.0138549805,0.049804688,0.052246094,0.07128906,0.018188477,-0.033691406,-0.0079956055,0.0033111572,-0.014099121,-0.012512207,-0.018188477,-0.0069885254,0.02319336,-0.0031280518,-0.00044822693,0.007446289,0.025634766,-0.051757812,-0.026000977,-0.017822266,-0.012084961,-0.013427734,0.046142578,-0.055419922,0.028198242,-0.04638672,0.014465332,0.017822266,-0.029785156,0.045898438,-0.1