49	Production 근거: `lib.analysis.py:upsert_wardevalutions()`의 column mapping과 conflict policy. Production의 ward validation SELECT, Kafka 전달, notifier 후속 처리는 Recovery에서 사용하지 않는다.\n\n## 19. 안전 제한\n\nRecovery 설계와 스크립트는 다음을 절대 수정하지 않는다.\n\n### PostgreSQL\n\n- `archive.resources_measurement`\n- `ansimk.resources_ward`\n- `ansimk.resources_location`\n- `ansimk.analysis_wardevaluation`\n- 기존 Production 테이블 전체\n\n### MongoDB\n\n- `safeguard-staging.device-daily`\n- `safeguard-staging`의 다른 collection\n- 기존 Production MongoDB database와 collection\n\n### repository 파일\n\n- Production 코드 전체\n- `rebuild_device_daily.py`\n- `postgres.py`\n- `mongodb.py`\n- `.env`\n- `pyproject.toml`\n- `uv.lock`\n- test 파일\n- 기존 Markdown 문서\n\n새 Recovery 구현은 Production 모듈을 import하거나 호출하지 않는다. 특히 `analyze_utils`, `analyze_user_stats`, `analyze_write_db`, `lib.analysis`, `lib.postgres`, `lib.mongo`, `notifier`는 import 시에도 DB pool/DDL, MongoDB client/index, Kafka publish 등의 side effect가 발생할 수 있다. 필요한 공식과 순수 note 로직만 독립적으로 이식한다.\n\n유일한 향후 write 대상은 `archive.analysis_wardevaluation`이다. 문서 작성 단계에서는 이 테이블도 변경하지 않는다.\n\n## 20. 검증\n\nRecovery 구현은 dry-run과 실제 실행 모두에서 최소한 다음을 집계·검증해야 한다.	[0.0071411133,-0.015075684,-0.010253906,-0.03125,0.071777344,0.008178711,0.051513672,-0.018798828,-0.026123047,0.021728516,-0.05859375,-0.0625,0.012756348,-0.007507324,-0.045166016,0.06982422,-0.017211914,-0.037841797,-0.06201172,0.044677734,0.071777344,-0.0053710938,0.03125,0.057373047,-0.06933594,-0.011291504,-0.0390625,-0.018188477,0.009155273,0.0087890625,0.049560547,-0.017822266,-0.08300781,-0.02319336,0.048828125,-0.010559082,-0.024291992,0.012756348,-0.03125,0.013000488,-0.003967285,0.064453125,0.08935547,0.009765625,-0.06738281,-0.09667969,0.012084961,0.013244629,-0.013061523,0.03466797,-0.06347656,0.011169434,-0.010864258,0.0034484863,0.011962891,-0.004547119,0.041503906,-0.092285156,-0.01373291,-0.026367188,-0.033691406,0.067871094,-0.01574707,-0.064453125,0.007293701,0.0015258789,5.507469e-05,-0.01550293,0.0016784