66	Convert experience-based practices into an\norganizational standard methodology.\n6\nComplete the company-standard glossary. Use it as the standard for all agents and document\nQA.\n7\nConduct a document automation PoC. Start with highly repetitive weekly reports, monthly\nreports, or a project execution plan.\n\nEnglish translation\n8\nKey Summary for Internal Sharing\nThe most important conclusion from this AX session is: "Do not start by building AI;\nstart by defining the company's work standards."\nPublic-sector projects generate many recurring tasks and deliverables from the business plan and\nproposal stages through commencement, execution, reporting, and completion. Standardizing\nthem first is therefore expected to create substantial value from AX.\nIf the Vice President's experience and know-how are organized as work processes, deliverable\nstandards, templates, a glossary, and a project methodology, then applied to AI agents, anyone will\nbe able to perform the work at a consistently high level.\nThe target outcome is a Public-Sector Project AX Agent that tells users\nwhat to do next when project information is entered, automatically drafts\nrequired documents according to company standards, and finally\nvalidates compliance with those standards.	[0,-0.064453125,-0.0061035156,-0.08251953,-0.052734375,-0.034423828,0.033691406,-0.04248047,-0.019165039,-0.047607422,-0.050048828,-0.029174805,-0.017089844,-0.007080078,-0.04321289,-0.016113281,-0.118652344,0.008728027,-0.09033203,0.04663086,-0.037597656,0.026000977,-0.026489258,-0.0044555664,-0.068847656,-0.03564453,0.012512207,0.079589844,0.026367188,0.0035858154,0.00074386597,0.038085938,-0.063964844,0.009277344,-0.007446289,-0.011474609,-0.02758789,-0.059814453,-0.020629883,0.030517578,-0.014221191,0.060058594,0.048095703,0.030761719,-0.025634766,-0.07910156,-0.055419922,-0.003967285,0.0058288574,0.01574707,0.016357422,0.0054626465,0.011657715,0.023803711,-0.025756836,0.018066406,0.018432617,-0.021118164,